requirements warehouse v1
description "Where the warehouse's decisions about who moves its stock, and who asks for an order to ship, come from. Written for the example"

role warehouse_lead "runs the warehouse, and decides who moves its stock and how"

requirement ordering_decides_when_an_order_ships
  text "Ordering decides when an order ships or is cancelled, and its workflow asks the warehouse's API for it; no one in the warehouse asks for either"
  owner warehouse_lead
  decided 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead "how ordering and the warehouse share the work of an order"
  satisfied by sekisho "../gates/warehouse.gate" policy ship_order_calls_the_warehouse
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:011fc21483e66565 -> sha256:c51b498a78b22719
  verified by sekisho "../gates/warehouse.gate" expect staff_neither_ship_nor_cancel
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:011fc21483e66565 -> sha256:814b1ecabb025d55

requirement holds_go_with_the_orders
  text "The stock an order takes is held for it by the warehouse's system, which posts the hold when the order ships and voids it when the order is cancelled; no one moves a hold by hand"
  owner warehouse_lead
  decided 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead "the stock on the shelves agrees with the orders"
  satisfied by sekisho "../gates/warehouse.gate" policy the_system_keeps_the_holds
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:3bb72bea70d71547 -> sha256:58cddfdbadbc62da
  satisfied by chobo "../warehouse/inventory.book" transfer reserve operation hold
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:3bb72bea70d71547 -> sha256:ef505e9c8dbb3bf1
  satisfied by chobo "../warehouse/inventory.book" transfer reserve operation post
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:3bb72bea70d71547 -> sha256:5a8d93c09a369494
  satisfied by chobo "../warehouse/inventory.book" transfer reserve operation void
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:3bb72bea70d71547 -> sha256:cf25ce9611880093
  verified by sekisho "../gates/warehouse.gate" expect holds_are_not_moved_by_hand
    reviewed 2026-10-07 by warehouse_lead sha256:3bb72bea70d71547 -> sha256:c9e99946dd37684b
